 entally launched his stand-up career after engaging with Michael Blackson i
 n an online roast battle so hard that Blackson invited him to his show and 
 handed him a mic\, since then Zac’s never looked back. He’s now a regul
 ar at Zanies Nashville and has opened for Shane Gillis\, Andrew Santino\, J
 oe List\, Doug Stanhope\, Big Jay Oakerson\, Jessica Kirson\, Steve-O\, and
  Earthquake. Offstage\, Zac co-created the viral sketch collective Paid Vac
 ation which has amassed over 65 million views across tiktok and instagram. 
 You’ve also seen him on Barstool Sports\, at the Nashville Comedy Festiva
